WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.240
Ever since I got bit by that spider

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.200
I've only had one week

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.920
where my life has felt normal

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.470
That was when you found out

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:28.480
When you botched that spell

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.950
where you wanted everyone to forget that

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.373
Peter Parker is Spider-Man,

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.340
we started getting some visitors

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.040
From every

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.669
universe

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.198
Hello, Peter

00:00:57.199 --> 00:00:58.852
You're not Peter Parker

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.133
I'm sorry what was your name again?

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.101
Doctor Otto Octavius

00:01:08.479 --> 00:01:10.841
Wait, no seriously what's your actual name?

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.265
There are others out there

00:01:13.265 --> 00:01:15.119
We need to send them back

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:17.843
So... Scooby-Doo this crap!

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:19.931
You know all this is kind of your mess

00:01:19.931 --> 00:01:21.702
I know a couple of magic words myself

00:01:21.702 --> 00:01:24.090
starting with the word please

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.773
Please, Scooby-Doo this crap.

00:01:32.479 --> 00:01:35.280
You're flying out into the darkness

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.688
to fight ghosts

00:01:36.688 --> 00:01:37.680
What do you mean?

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.479
They all die fighting Spider-Man

00:01:40.479 --> 00:01:42.131
It's their fate

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.960
I'm sorry kid

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.300
Yeah me too

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.028
Don't!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.667
Look, there has to be another way

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:56.543
There isn't

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.084
They're a danger to our universe

00:02:00.084 --> 00:02:01.386
You'll never take this away from me

00:02:02.943 --> 00:02:04.190
Peter,

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.655
you're struggling

00:02:07.439 --> 00:02:10.959
to have everything you want

00:02:10.959 --> 00:02:15.000
while the world tries to make you choose

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.235
This is all my fault

00:02:19.235 --> 00:02:20.856
I can't save everyone

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.239
What's happening?

00:02:42.239 --> 00:02:44.160
They're starting to come through

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.010
and I can't stop them

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.525
December 17th exclusively in movie theaters

00:02:50.525 --> 00:02:53.420
Tickets on sale november 29th, Spider-Monday

